253-Default route policy for this maintenance class:
254-- primary route: stay at document-level benchmark while the live question is doc/runtime parity, chapter-family answerability, or benchmark coverage
255-- fallback route: escalate to assembled replay when ambiguity, conflict, or behavior-critical claims need stronger evidence than document-grounded review can provide
256-- final ownership reroutes to `eval-ops` once the decision depends on replay execution state, benchmark gating, or release-sensitive continuation rather than route comparison alone
