259-- for `runtime owner integrity` and `benchmark-loop adequacy`, document-level benchmark is the primary sufficient surface when runtime-owned docs directly expose the owner boundary or benchmark loop
260-- replay escalation is not required for those families unless the claim extends from document/runtime parity into assembled behavior proof or runner execution state
